    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "legend_0040_friend_a",
      "hash64": "7CCEC4C0C174FC0A",
      "text": "It says here that the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Sweet Herba Mystica[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] is good\\nfor gut health and that it helps aid digestion.\\c\\nSays it’s great for stomachaches, too, or when\\nyou want to stimulate the ol’ appetite![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
