      "hash64": "7CCEC2C0C174F8A4",
      "text": "[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Bitter Herba Mystica[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]’s great for your circulation!\\nIt really gets the blood flowing!\\c\\nAnd that warms you right up, nice and toasty,\\neven boosting the immune system!\\c\\n...Or so it says.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
